   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Scale for convert. The paper names it as the one command that does not finish within a day even at two flags, and says its behaviour is simple: read one file, write another.\nThe agent spent its effort on the interface instead (which words are options, how many words each consumes), testing one option at a time; only a few checks paired two.",
   "originalText": "Scale for convert. The paper names it as the one command that does not finish within a day even at two flags, and says its behaviour is simple: read one file, write another.\nThe agent spent its effort on the interface instead (which words are options, how many words each consumes), testing one option at a time; only a few checks paired two.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "width": 1557,
   "height": 38
  },
  {
   "id": "footer",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
